{"kind": "mod", "id": 1548, "name": "Simple Season Selector", "slug": "simple-season-selector", "teaser": "Wish you could select the season in SPT instead of relying on the inevitable passage of time? Now you can.", "owner_name": "sheepy", "downloads": 22921, "favourites": 1, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.sheepy.simpleseasondetector", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:58.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-07-11T07:47:21.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-07-11T07:47:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.1.5", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>Yep, I finally did it, made my first proper mod. This one is fairly straightforward: instead of SPT determining what season the game should be based on the date, you can force a specific one using this mod.</p>\n<p>To disable seasonal events, use a mod like <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2440-disable-seasonal-events/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kuromi’s Disable Seasonal Events</a>.</p>\n<p>To randomly select seasons, use a mod like <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2610-random-season-ripoff\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Random Season Ripoff</a>.</p>\n<p>To complexly select seasons, use a mod like <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2745-seasonaloverride-dynamicweather/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Season Override &amp; Dynamic Weather</a>.</p>\n<p>Installation:</p>\n<p>Drag and drop the content of the archive into your SPT folder. Please use <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">7zip</a>.</p>\n<p>Configuration:</p>\n<p>You can set the desired season inside<br />\nuser\\mods\\Sheepy-SimpleSeasonSelector\\config\\config.jsonc<br />\nUse notepad to edit it. In case something went wrong, it will automatically pick Auto.</p>\n<p>Special thanks go to Chomp for making the mod examples and AcidPhantasm for parts of the code and feedback.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3594, "published_at": "2024-11-26T15:19:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1548/simple-season-selector/1.1.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.4", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 4821, "published_at": "2024-12-31T11:27:18.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1548/simple-season-selector/1.1.4", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.5", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 5704, "published_at": "2025-03-15T19:58:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1548/simple-season-selector/1.1.5", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["sheepiest/Simple-Season-Selector"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/sheepiest/Simple-Season-Selector", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": false, "obtainable": true, "dep_problems": 0}